      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.36,
          "en": "So now that you know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.36,
          "end": 7.47,
          "en": "how Code Interpreter can generally be used,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.47,
          "end": 9.72,
          "en": "let's explore prompt engineering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.72,
          "end": 12.48,
          "en": "with Code Interpreter enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.48,
          "end": 15.81,
          "en": "And the good news here is that in general",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.81,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "the same prompt engineering techniques",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 20.82,
          "en": "about which you learned early on this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.82,
          "end": 24.57,
          "en": "also do apply when working with Code Interpreter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.57,
          "end": 28.38,
          "en": "for example we could create and send a prompt like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.38,
          "end": 32.58,
          "en": "to ChatGPT with Code Interpreter enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.58,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "We're giving ChatGPT a role and a goal again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "and then some additional context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 41.85,
          "en": "for example, the input data for this investment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.85,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "which I want to calculate with that message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 48.66,
          "en": "So the amount initially invested, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.66,
          "end": 51.63,
          "en": "the expected annual rate of return,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.63,
          "end": 53.76,
          "en": "and additional amount invested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.76,
          "end": 57.33,
          "en": "that will be invested every year at the end of that year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.33,
          "end": 59.97,
          "en": "the duration of this investment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.97,
          "end": 61.92,
          "en": "so how long we wanna hold it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.92,
          "end": 64.89,
          "en": "until we wanna get our money back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.89,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "And then I'm giving ChatGPT some additional context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 72.33,
          "en": "regarding the expected result it should produce.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.33,
          "end": 76.083,
          "en": "So some details about that result it should generate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.01,
          "end": 81.12,
          "en": "And with that, with Code Interpreter enabled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.12,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "if we send a prompt like this to ChatGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 88.08,
          "en": "it'll again try to solve this task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.08,
          "end": 93.08,
          "en": "and all our extra details will help ChatGPT solve that task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 96,
          "en": "But now, as you can see here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96,
          "end": 100.68,
          "en": "it starts by giving me a formula I could use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.68,
          "end": 104.07,
          "en": "to derive the value of my investment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.07,
          "end": 106.35,
          "en": "and all these intermediate results,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.35,
          "end": 108.18,
          "en": "but it then also goes ahead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.18,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "and produces some code and executes that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 114.87299999999999,
          "en": "to give me the results for that investment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.07,
          "end": 117.9,
          "en": "Now here in this case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.9,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "it actually produced some wrong results at first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 124.44,
          "en": "It produced some wrong results because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.44,
          "end": 126.72,
          "en": "the formatting of those numbers is off,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 130.8,
          "en": "and more importantly that second row here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.8,
          "end": 132.693,
          "en": "contains some incorrect result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 137.587,
          "en": "The interest gained in this second year is not 1,308,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.87,
          "end": 142.443,
          "en": "but instead 708 would be the correct result here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 147.09,
          "en": "But for some reason here, ChatGPT messed up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 147.09,
          "end": 150.51,
          "en": "with the code it produced and executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.51,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "and therefore of course we can use prompting techniques",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "we already know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 157.86,
          "en": "For example, we can send a follow-up prompt here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.86,
          "end": 161.46,
          "en": "where we tell ChatGPT to improve the formatting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.46,
          "end": 164.7,
          "en": "and where we make ChatGPT aware of that mistake",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.7,
          "end": 165.963,
          "en": "it introduced here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.25,
          "end": 169.47,
          "en": "And in my case it then indeed went ahead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 171.39,
          "en": "and gave you some details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.39,
          "end": 173.16,
          "en": "on how it should derive the result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.16,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "and it then performed that calculation again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 177.96,
          "en": "based on updated code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.96,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "And here it actually did that multiple times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 182.94,
          "en": "since it wasn't happy with the results it got.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.94,
          "end": 186.66,
          "en": "So it gradually tried to improve itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 187.68,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.68,
          "end": 192.243,
          "en": "finally it then did produce some correct output for me here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.5,
          "end": 195.9,
          "en": "Now I wanna mention that it's also possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 198.24,
          "en": "that you got the correct output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.24,
          "end": 200.82,
          "en": "right after sending that first prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.82,
          "end": 204.87,
          "en": "so that you did not need to send any follow-up prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.87,
          "end": 206.76,
          "en": "And it's also possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.76,
          "end": 209.79,
          "en": "that even after sending this follow-up prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.79,
          "end": 212.13,
          "en": "and even more follow-up prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.13,
          "end": 215.85,
          "en": "ChatGPT was not able to produce the correct results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 220.8,
          "en": "I had both cases whilst preparing for this recording here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.8,
          "end": 223.32,
          "en": "because ChatGPT in general",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.32,
          "end": 228.09,
          "en": "and of course all the Code Interpreter still is not perfect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.09,
          "end": 231.96,
          "en": "After all ChatGPT is still able to hallucinate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.96,
          "end": 234.51,
          "en": "and produce wrong results and it's therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.51,
          "end": 238.71,
          "en": "of course also able to produce wrong code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 238.71,
          "end": 242.49,
          "en": "So it absolutely can happen that ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.49,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "produces code that does execute correctly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.03,
          "end": 248.76,
          "en": "but that simply contains some logical bugs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 248.76,
          "end": 253.23,
          "en": "and errors that therefore lead to wrong results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.23,
          "end": 257.13,
          "en": "And hence, even with Code Interpreter enabled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.13,
          "end": 259.5,
          "en": "you of course should always be careful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.5,
          "end": 263.28,
          "en": "and double check the results ChatGPT is generating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 263.28,
          "end": 266.103,
          "en": "because they might contain errors.",
          "zh": ""
        }
